WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.270
A lab is handed a small
bag of white powder.

2
00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:05.610
No label, and no clues.

3
00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:08.870
With a wire loop, a Bunsen
flame and a few drops of test

4
00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:12.050
solutions, a chemist can
name the metal inside it,

5
00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:15.290
and the non-metal part
as well, in minutes.

6
00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:19.690
So how can a few simple tests
identify an unknown substance?

7
00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:23.130
In this mission, you'll hold a
sample in a flame and read its

8
00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:23.690
colour.

9
00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:27.050
You'll add sodium hydroxide
solution and watch for coloured

10
00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:31.510
solids, then test for carbonate,
halide and sulfate ions.

11
00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:34.850
You'll also learn the
tests for common gases.

12
00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:38.610
Your mission: work out how a
few tests can name a mystery

13
00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:39.770
powder.
